      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "As dipyridamole is excreted in human milk, caution should be exercised when dipyridamole tablets are administered to a nursing woman.",
